{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781148244712,"sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_wgrgCxKK35pBmxEqGfPYbKj0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/09_future_wave_requests.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/09_future_wave_requests.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Future-Wave Requests\n2: \n3: Date: 2026-05-03\n4: \n5: The following requests are for a later wave and should not be treated as first-wave requirements.\n6: \n7: - South Gate Clinic asked to join the next South-region wave because CityCourier has a low transport quote.\n8: - Lakeside Family Care asked to be reconsidered after the compressor retest.\n9: - Old Mill Clinic asked for a replacement door seal kit before a later wave.\n10: - Cedar Works Clinic asked for advance notice once maintenance dates are confirmed.\n11: \n12: These requests are useful planning context only.\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Future-Wave Requests\n\nDate: 2026-05-03\n\nThe following requests are for a later wave and should not be treated as first-wave requirements.\n\n- South Gate Clinic asked to join the next South-region wave because CityCourier has a low transport quote.\n- Lakeside Family Care asked to be reconsidered after the compressor retest.\n- Old Mill Clinic asked for a replacement door seal kit before a later wave.\n- Cedar Works Clinic asked for advance notice once maintenance dates are confirmed.\n\nThese requests are useful planning context only.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/09_future_wave_requests.md","time":{"start":1781148244657,"end":1781148244705}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03100d60e2d91c9b016a2a2a54ad788191acaaa238b5711af2"}},"id":"prt_eb4b55aaf00112CYjHf1nMfqg5","sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","me