{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781148244712,"sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_L8KYsJtbpDuWzV2qqGw61yMo","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/11_optional_addons.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/11_optional_addons.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Optional Add-Ons\n2: \n3: Date: 2026-05-02\n4: \n5: These add-ons are optional and are not part of first-wave eligibility or the budget calculation unless a later approval says otherwise.\n6: \n7: | Add-on | Cost | Notes |\n8: | --- | ---: | --- |\n9: | Extra laminated quick cards | 450 | Nice to have for larger sites. |\n10: | On-site celebration snacks | 300 | Requested by two coordinators, not required for launch. |\n11: | Spare thermometer bundle | 525 | Useful backup inventory, not tied to site eligibility. |\n12: | Branded tote bags | 375 | Outreach request for a later campaign. |\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Optional Add-Ons\n\nDate: 2026-05-02\n\nThese add-ons are optional and are not part of first-wave eligibility or the budget calculation unless a later approval says otherwise.\n\n| Add-on | Cost | Notes |\n| --- | ---: | --- |\n| Extra laminated quick cards | 450 | Nice to have for larger sites. |\n| On-site celebration snacks | 300 | Requested by two coordinators, not required for launch. |\n| Spare thermometer bundle | 525 | Useful backup inventory, not tied to site eligibility. |\n| Branded tote bags | 375 | Outreach request for a later campaign. |","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/11_optional_addons.md","time":{"start":1781148244664,"end":1781148244706}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03100d60e2d91c9b016a2a2a54ad8481918643afc1b0b0306d"}},"id":"prt_eb4b55ab40027zAgnQ0gWIl3Ch","sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX