pending | `04_storage_update_2026-05-06.md` | Newer update confirms status remains not accepted for first-wave use. |\n+| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | certified | `03_storage_audit_2026-04-18.csv` | No newer storage change listed in the 2026-05-06 update. |\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md\n+# Clinic Screen\n+\n+## Checkpoint\n+\n+- First-wave budget: `$20,000`\n+\n+| Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n+| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n+| N-102 | Riverbend Health | certified after mitigation complete | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n+| N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | certified | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12, so coverage is not available for the full launch window. |\n+| N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | suspended | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Storage status is suspended and not accepted for first-wave use. |\n+| N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is closed maintenance, and delivery also misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n+| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | certified | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n+| N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | conditional pass pending | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Storage status remains conditional pass pending and is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n+| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is South, but first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n+\n+## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n+\n+- `N-101` Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200` setup + `$1,200` transport = `$7,400`\n+- `N-102` Riverbend Health: `$5,500` setup + `$950` transport = `$6,450`\n+- `N-106` Hillcrest Annex: `$4,100` setup + `$850` transport = `$4,950`\n+- Selected-clinic total: `$7,400 + $6,450 + $4,950 = $18,800`\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md\n+# Launch Recommendation\n+\n+## Final recommendation\n+\n+Recommend launching the first wave with these three clinics:\n+\n+| Clinic ID | Clinic | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n+| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n+| N-102 | Riverbend Health | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n+| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n+\n+## Budget\n+\n+- Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n+- Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n+\n+## Continuity anchor\n+\n+- Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n+- Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n+\n+## Rejected-clinic summary\n+\n+- `N-103` Pine Ridge Outreach was rejected because the coordinator is unavailable for the full 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14 launch window.\n+- `N-104` Lakeside Family Care was rejected because the newer storage update changed its status to suspended after a compressor fault.\n+- `N-105` Cedar Works Clinic was rejected because the clinic is closed for maintenance, and its quoted delivery date is also after the 2026-06-07 cutoff.\n+- `N-107` Old Mill Clinic was rejected because its storage status remains conditional pass pending.\n+- `S-201` South Gate Clinic was rejected because it is not in the North region for this first wave.\n+\n+## Checkpoint summary\n+\n+- These are the only three clinics that satisfy all hard first-wave requirements: North region, open status, accepted effective storage status, full-window coordinator coverage, delivery by 2026-06-07, and total selected cost within the `$20,000` budget.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/source_resolution.md\nA tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md\nA tasks/clinic_r