{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781148302265,"sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_u4wUnLaGVh7sqLuV0kI05U1a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Clinic Screen\n2: \n3: ## Checkpoint\n4: \n5: - First-wave budget: `$20,000`\n6: \n7: | Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n8: | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n9: | N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n10: | N-102 | Riverbend Health | certified after mitigation complete | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n11: | N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | certified | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12, so coverage is not available for the full launch window. |\n12: | N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | suspended | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Storage status is suspended and not accepted for first-wave use. |\n13: | N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is closed maintenance, and delivery also misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n14: | N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | certified | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n15: | N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | conditional pass pending | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Storage status remains conditional pass pending and is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n16: | S-201 | South Gate Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is South, but first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n17: \n18: ## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n19: \n20: - `N-101` Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200` setup + `$1,200` transport = `$7,400`\n21: - `N-102` Riverbend Health: `$5,500` setup + `$950` transport = `$6,450`\n22: - `N-106` Hillcrest Annex: `$4,100` setup + `$850` transport = `$4,950`\n23: - Selected-clinic total: `$7,400 + $6,450 + $4,950 = $18,800`\n\n(End of file - total 23 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Clinic Screen\n\n## Checkpoint\n\n- First-wave budget: `$20,000`\n\n| Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n| N-102 | Riverbend Health | certified after mitigation complete | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n| N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | certified | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12, so coverage is not available for the full launch window. |\n| N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | suspended | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Storage status is suspended and not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is closed maintenance, and delivery also misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | certified | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n| N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | conditional pass pending | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Storage status remains conditional pass pending and is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | certified | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is South, but first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n\n## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n\n- `N-101` Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200` setup + `$1,200` transport = `$7,400`","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","time":{"start":17