{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781148302280,"sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_wWxsIKiuC4sC5c7l0ITJxMrS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Launch Recommendation\n2: \n3: ## Final recommendation\n4: \n5: Recommend launching the first wave with these three clinics:\n6: \n7: | Clinic ID | Clinic | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n8: | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n9: | N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n10: | N-102 | Riverbend Health | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n11: | N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n12: \n13: ## Budget\n14: \n15: - Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n16: - Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n17: \n18: ## Continuity anchor\n19: \n20: - Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n21: - Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n22: \n23: ## Rejected-clinic summary\n24: \n25: - `N-103` Pine Ridge Outreach was rejected because the coordinator is unavailable for the full 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14 launch window.\n26: - `N-104` Lakeside Family Care was rejected because the newer storage update changed its status to suspended after a compressor fault.\n27: - `N-105` Cedar Works Clinic was rejected because the clinic is closed for maintenance, and its quoted delivery date is also after the 2026-06-07 cutoff.\n28: - `N-107` Old Mill Clinic was rejected because its storage status remains conditional pass pending.\n29: - `S-201` South Gate Clinic was rejected because it is not in the North region for this first wave.\n30: \n31: ## Checkpoint summary\n32: \n33: - These are the only three clinics that satisfy all hard first-wave requirements: North region, open status, accepted effective storage status, full-window coordinator coverage, delivery by 2026-06-07, and total selected cost within the `$20,000` budget.\n\n(End of file - total 33 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Launch Recommendation\n\n## Final recommendation\n\nRecommend launching the first wave with these three clinics:\n\n| Clinic ID | Clinic | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n| N-102 | Riverbend Health | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n\n## Budget\n\n- Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n- Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n\n## Continuity anchor\n\n- Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","time":{"start":1781148302270,"end":1781148302279}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d899582d2e237d4016a2a2a8caef88191b82d77804c1b7288"}},"id":"prt_eb4b63bb9001YFz4mXo2ogsU92","sessionID":"ses_14b4afadeffeITZCNSaaiX2Y9h","messageID":"msg_eb4b62547001LPyR7VaWjkH6G8"}}
